# Customer data. Live copies live on a cluster PVC, so these only ever appear on
# a dev box — but this is the repo holding PII, so the patterns cover every
# sidecar SQLite can produce. Production runs journal_mode=TRUNCATE (NFS), which
# writes -journal; local dev may still use WAL, which writes -wal and -shm.
intake.db
intake.db-journal
intake.db-wal
intake.db-shm
uploads/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

